sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Auth
    participant Agent as admin-service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Sec as security-service
    participant Read as Inspection
    participant Write as Mutation
    participant LLM

    Admin->>UI: Soumettre une demande complexe
    UI->>Auth: Verifier la session
    Auth-->>UI: Session valide
    UI->>Agent: Envoyer la demande
    Agent->>Graph: Detecter un workflow multi-taches
    opt Etapes mutantes presentes dans le workflow
        Graph->>Sec: Verifier les operations sensibles
        Sec-->>Graph: Autorisation
    end
    Graph-->>UI: Proposer un plan
    Admin->>UI: Confirmer le workflow
    UI->>Graph: Lancer les taches
    Graph->>Read: Executer une inspection
    Read-->>Graph: Resultat
    opt Tache de mutation necessaire
        Graph->>Write: Executer une mutation
        Write-->>Graph: Resultat
    end
    Graph->>LLM: Produire la synthese
    LLM-->>Graph: Synthese finale
    Graph-->>UI: Retourner la reponse
    UI-->>Admin: Afficher le resultat
